response r. We approximate the score as: SA(r) ≈
Q(r) + bA(r) and obtain
P(rA ≻rB | x) = σ(δ + bA),
where δ = Q(rA) −Q(rB) captures the qual-
ity gap between the two responses, and bA =
bA(rA)−bA(rB) reflects the bias of judge A. In the
