Application
We introduce four applications which LLM-as-a-
judge can be applied: evaluation (Section 5.1),
alignment (Section 5.2), retrieval (Section 5.3), and
reasoning (Section ??). Due to the space limitation,
we provide a more detailed version in Appendix C.
