2025), DPO (Saha et al., 2025) or distillation (Zhao
et al., 2025) to train LLMs to serve as more effec-
tive judges.
Future Directions. While LLM-as-a-judge ap-
proaches benefit from ITS techniques, it is
also important to recognize the associated chal-
lenges. These include efficiency bottlenecks (Sui
et al., 2025), performance degradation from over-
thinking (Chen et al., 2024e), and increased vul-
nerability of long CoTs to adversarial attack (Jiang
et al., 2025). Future research could investigate
these limitations and develop mitigation strategies,
paving the way for more efficient, accurate, and
robust judge LLMs enhanced by ITS.
