have emerged to assess LLM capabilities across
various domains (Hendrycks et al., 2020; Srivas-
tava et al., 2023).
Many of these benchmarks,
such as those for arithmetic or code execution (e.g.,
GSM-Hard, HumanEval (Gao et al., 2022; Chen
et al., 2021)), use automated scoring to evaluate
problem-solving skills. However, their focus is
not on quality of generated content or limited to
the cases where the generated contents are auto-
