4
Experiments
To investigate the usefulness of checklist-based au-
tomatic evaluation, this study conducts experiments
on two tasks: (1) a pairwise comparison task, in
which pairs of LLM’s responses are judged for rel-
ative quality, and (2) a direct scoring task, in which
LLM’s responses are rated using a Likert scale.
