Conclusions
We regard improving the capability of LLM-as-a-
judge as a part of improving the model’s general
ability, proposing a SFT-DPO two-stage training
approach. In these two stages, we respectively ac-
complished the tasks of judge style adaptation and
the enhancement of judging capabilities, achiev-
ing SOTA results on RewardBench. Additionally,
we introduced an efficient data synthesis method,
14106


