3.5
Evaluation metrics
We report conventional accuracy and QWK to-
gether with three uncertainty-aware measures in-
troduced in Section 2: Coverage, the empirical
proportion of essays whose true label lies in the
prediction set; Average set size, a proxy for infor-
mativeness; and UAcc, which trades off accuracy
against set size.
