and Qwen differ by only four accuracy points (0.54
vs 0.50), yet Llama’s sets are 0.8 labels tighter,
boosting UAcc from 0.88 to 1.08. In practice that
means nearly 20 % fewer essays would be flagged
for manual review at the same error rate—an o

