contests, would itself be good at judging such con-
tests, and that a good judge is expected to have
low variance, being consistent in its answers, we
explored using the Consistency score as a proxy
for a model’s Elo score.
Consistency scores have the benefit of not re-
quiring any human feedback or prior knowledge
