Experimental Setup
We employed 24 LLMs, selected to cover a diverse
range of Elo scores (listed in Table 1 in section A.2
of the Appendix). These scores range from 1008 to
1315, based on the most recent available LMSYS
Chatbot Arena Leaderboard dataset. Each judge
LLM was used to evaluate and select preferences
between responses generated by othe

