additional matchups can be incorporated as long
as matchups with high Elo differences are priori-
tized.
4
Conclusion
We introduce Consistency scores as a simple, scal-
able metric for estimating LLM intelligence by
measuring a model’s consistency in preferring the
same winner in repeated pairwise matchups. This
score strongly correlates with LMSYS Elo scores
30170


